# WHITELIST — this repo is PUBLIC.
#
# Everything is ignored by default. A file reaches GitHub only if it is
# un-ignored below. That way a new planning doc dropped into this folder is
# excluded automatically, instead of relying on someone remembering to add it.
#
# Never un-ignore: TIME_EFFORT.md (rates, margins), OPEN_QUESTIONS.md,
# insurance/DOU.md and the proposal .docx (payment structure), or anything with
# a client's details in it.
#
# Adding a vertical? Add its two lines to the per-vertical block below.

*

# --- core (industry-agnostic) ---
!.gitignore
!CNAME
!README.md
!index.html
!config.example.json
!apps-script/
!apps-script/*.gs

# --- verticals: config + redirect stubs + seed data only ---
# Deliberately NOT `!insurance/*` — that would publish DOU.md and the proposal.
!insurance/
!insurance/README.md
!insurance/Seed.gs
!insurance/config-*.json
!insurance/*/
!insurance/*/index.html
